haha, I do speak lojbanically; as often as I can.  It's mostly the nit-picky 
theory-oriented side of me that's irked by the fact that all the sumti slots of 
a selbri are same except in this one way.  You use fa to move around to the 
slots or se to swap them around, all of this you do the same way for all of 
them.  They all live by the same rules.... except this one.
